    "dream_name": "Paws on Paradise",
    "story_prompt": "A pampered corgi, Winston, enjoys a luxurious tropical cruise, but his dreams take him on a surreal adventure through the ship's machinery and fantastical ocean realms.",
    "initial_goal": "To wake up feeling refreshed and ready for more belly rubs.",
    "pitch": "Imagine this: a corgi, Winston, regal and fluffy, fast asleep on a plush sun lounger aboard a vibrant tropical cruise ship. We open on his peaceful slumber, then his dreams begin. Suddenly, the world melts away and we\u2019re plunged into a whimsical, stylized version of the ship\u2019s inner workings - giant, spinning gears become playful jungle gyms, pipes transform into cascading waterfalls, and the engine room bursts into a bioluminescent coral reef teeming with friendly, cartoonish fish. Winston, still dreaming, navigates this bizarre landscape, encountering charming, anthropomorphic ship crew members who assist him on his journey. The style will be a blend of \u2018Paddington\u2019 and \u2018Zootopia\u2019 - bright, colorful, and full of heart. The audio should incorporate playful, tropical music layered with the gentle sounds of waves and the occasional, adorable corgi snore. Finally, after overcoming a minor, dream-logic obstacle (perhaps a rogue, oversized pineapple), Winston drifts back to a peaceful state, waking up to the gentle rocking of the ship and the promise of a treat. It\u2019s a film about finding joy in the unexpected, and it\u2019s absolutely paw-some.",
